    "updated_at": "2025-07-18T18:52:13Z",
    "body": "> Which is to say, I think the answer to \"what should I use for key-value storage in my ServiceWorker\" is IndexedDB and we can probably close this.\n\nI agree, and I think between IndexedDB and LocalStorage there are sufficient alternatives to cookies for this.",
