    "updated_at": "2025-07-21T09:26:51Z",
    "body": "`localStorage` isn't available in many of the environments that the Cookie Store API is available in, so that argument doesn't hold.\n\nI'm not sure if this is new since 2018, but the limits imposed on cookies probably also help make them less attractive as general-purpose storage.",
