    "created_at": "2025-07-21T21:08:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-21T21:08:07Z",
    "body": "Yes, I think the cookie limits and the resulting risk sites create about expiring their own cookies prematurely makes this less of a concern, especially since I think site authors are much more likely aware of these possible downsides now than they were then.",
